<title>USA: GM Japan Cadillac unit appoints D'Arcy Masius.</title>
<headline>GM Japan Cadillac unit appoints D'Arcy Masius.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>D'Arcy Masius Benton &amp; Bowles Communications said on Wednesday that its Japanese unit D'Arcy Masius Benton &amp; Bowles/TAI was named advertising and marketing agency of record by General Motors Corp's General Motors Japan Cadillac unit.</p>
<p>D'Arcy Masius Benton &amp; Bowles is a unit of MacManus Group, a privately held holding company.</p>
